<h2 id=3D"implementation">Implementation</h2>
<p>In this implementation, we'll identify each point using their index in t=
he points array. This means that for <code>n</code> points, each point is r=
epresented by an index from 0 to <code>n - 1</code>. By doing this, we can =
set up a Union-Find data structure with a capacity of <code>n</code> so tha=
t there are <code>n</code> groups initially, with each group containing one=
 of the <code>n</code> points.</p>
